<title>USA: CrossLand Mortgage to acquire Harbourton Mortgage.</title>
<headline>CrossLand Mortgage to acquire Harbourton Mortgage.</headline>
<dateline>SALT LAKE CITY 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Crossland Mortgage Corp, a subsidiary of First Security Corp, said it will acquire the wholesale loan production branch operations of  Harbourton Mortgage Co LP, a subsidiary of Harbourton Financial Services LP.</p>
<p>Crossland will pay approximately $4 million cash and an earnout paymnent based on loan volume during the 13 months following the merger.  Based on Harbourton's 1996 originations, the earnout payment would be about $3.3 million.</p>
<p>The acquisition is expected to be closed during the first quarter of 1997.</p>
</text>
